5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Since it's the first day, let's start by getting a feel for everyone. Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they'd like to share to help us find the werewolf?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us be patient and kind to one another; perhaps by listening closely to each other's hearts, the truth will reveal itself naturally.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Minako. We need a clear strategy. Since we have a Seer among us, the most logical approach is to protect them while they gather information. Let's observe how everyone reacts today.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A sound suggestion, Mizuki. Logic is indeed our best ally here. I believe observing the nuances of our conversation will be quite revealing. I look forward to seeing who among us is truly transparent.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to play! I'll do my best to help everyone. Let's all be honest and work together so we can find the werewolf quickly! Who do you guys think looks the most suspicious so far?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, it's a bit early to call anyone suspicious, but your enthusiasm is noted. Let's focus on how people respond to the idea of protecting the Seer. Does anyone have a specific method in mind?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Perhaps we can simply be mindful of who tries too hard to lead us astray. A gentle heart is often the easiest to recognize, don't you think? I trust you all to be honest.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, while kindness is appreciated, we cannot rely on intuition alone in a game of deception. We need concrete patterns. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become a target. We must be cautious.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Mizuki makes a valid point. A premature revelation would be an invitation for the werewolf to strike. The art of this game lies in the balance between gathering intelligence and maintaining a strategic silence.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"That makes sense! I don't want the Seer to get hurt. But if we're all being quiet, how will we know who to trust? Maybe we can share things we notice about each other instead!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, sharing observations is a good idea, but we must be careful not to create false leads. Let's see if anyone's behavior shifts as we approach the first vote tomorrow. Does anyone feel uneasy?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel quite peaceful, thank you for asking, Minako. I only hope that we can all remain friends, regardless of the roles we have been given. It would be a shame to let suspicion cloud our kindness.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your desire for harmony is touching, but we must remember that the werewolf is actively pretending to be our friend. We cannot let sentimentality blind us to the logical necessity of suspicion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Mizuki. Sentiment is a fragile shield against a predator. While Shizue's warmth is comforting, we must remember that the most effective camouflage is often a facade of absolute innocence. Logic requires us to question everything.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, Benjamin, that sounds a bit scary! But I get what you mean. I'll try to keep my eyes open and see if anyone is acting weird, even if they seem super nice!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Let's keep this level of vigilance. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we all reflect on these conversations tonight. Tomorrow, we will have to be decisive. I'll see you all then.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Minako. Let us all have a restful night and wake up with clear minds. I shall be praying for the safety of everyone in our little village. Sleep well, dear friends.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be analyzing everyone's speech patterns and reactions carefully. Let's hope the Seer finds a useful lead tonight. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent conclusion to our first day. I shall spend my evening in quiet contemplation, weighing the words spoken here. May the night be enlightening for those who seek the truth. Goodnight.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to think really hard about what we talked about today. I hope we can find the werewolf tomorrow! See you all in the morning!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
