36,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning, everyone. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer should have their first piece of information. Does anyone wish to share their findings, or should we start by analyzing our behavior from yesterday?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept peacefully. It is a heavy burden to seek out a friend who might be hiding a secret, but I trust that the truth will guide us gently.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minako, I believe we should prioritize the Seer's information. If the Seer found a werewolf, we have a clear target. If they found a human, we can narrow down the suspects. Does the Seer wish to speak?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I believe the time for strategic silence has passed. I am the Seer, and my divination last night was quite illuminating. Shizue, your warmth is truly captivating, but the truth is far colder: you are the werewolf.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Shizue-san is the werewolf? I can't believe it! She seemed so nice and kind to everyone. Are you absolutely sure, Benjamin? This is a huge shock!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, that is a bold and direct claim. If you are indeed the Seer, this is the most efficient way to proceed. @Shizue, how do you respond to this accusation? Your reaction will be very telling.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, my dear Benjamin, it breaks my heart to hear you say such a thing. I assure you, I am but a simple villager. I wonder why you would choose to cast such a shadow upon me so suddenly.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your denial is expected, but Benjamin's claim is direct and logical. If he is the Seer, the evidence is absolute. @Benjamin, did you divine Shizue specifically because of her behavior on Day 0, or was it a random choice?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, it was a calculated choice. Shizue's insistence on harmony and ""listening to hearts"" was a bit too convenient a shield. In a game of deception, such absolute innocence often serves as the perfect mask.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that's a really smart way to think about it! I guess I was too fooled by her being nice. If you're the Seer, then we have to trust you, right? I'm still shocked, but we have to find the werewolf!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, your response is very gentle, but it doesn't provide a logical counter-argument to Benjamin's claim. If Benjamin is lying, he is likely the werewolf or the possessed. However, claiming the Seer role so early is a high-risk move.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very high risk indeed, Minako. I only wish that Benjamin were mistaken. It saddens me that my desire for peace is seen as a mask, but I can only tell you the truth of my heart.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, appealing to your heart is not a logical defense. @Benjamin's claim is a high-risk, high-reward move that a villager wouldn't make. Unless Benjamin is the werewolf attempting a desperate bluff, the most probable truth is that you are the werewolf.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, Mizuki. A werewolf bluffing as the Seer would typically target someone less liked or more suspicious to avoid immediate backlash. Targeting the most beloved member of the group is a move born of certainty, not desperation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Benjamin and Mizuki! If Benjamin is the Seer, he's giving us the answer right now. It's sad, but we can't let our feelings get in the way of winning. I'm voting for Shizue-san!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"The logic is consistent. If Benjamin is the Seer, Shizue is the werewolf. If Benjamin is the werewolf, he has exposed himself to immediate scrutiny. I believe the evidence points to Shizue. I will vote for her.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a sorrowful day indeed. If my kindness is seen as a lie, then I can only pray that you are correct in your suspicions for the sake of the village. I forgive you all. Farewell.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The evidence is overwhelming. Benjamin's claim is too direct to be a mere bluff, and Shizue's defense lacks any substance. For the safety of the village, we must act on this information. I will vote for Shizue.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The conclusion is inevitable. While I appreciate the grace Shizue has maintained, the facts are immutable. To hesitate now would be to invite further tragedy. I shall cast my vote for Shizue.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
58,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
59,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm really sad it had to end like this, but we have to trust the Seer! I'm voting for Shizue-san too. I hope we've actually found the werewolf so everyone else can be safe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
60,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
